    {
      "text": "the Lord took Zion of Enoch to his bosom, D&C 38:4. Enoch and his city were separated from earth, D&C 45:12–14 (107:49). priesthood after order of Melchizedek is after order of Enoch, D&C 76:57. those who inherit celestial glory come to Church of Enoch, D&C 76:67. priesthood was passed through lineage of fathers from Enoch to Noah1 to Abel, D&C 84:15–16. Enoch saw the Lord and walked with him continually, D&C 107:49. Enoch was called to gathering of Adam’s posterity at Adam-ondi-Ahman, D&C 107:53. gathering of Adam’s posterity recorded in book of Enoch, D&C 107:57.",
